pace they want. But, Microsoft on the other hand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:51.660
was thirsty for marketshare. Bing and Edge had&nbsp;
been getting destroyed by Google for years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:58.200
so AI was Microsoft’s big shot at taking back&nbsp;
the lead and they ate it up. At the same time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:03.780
OpenAI was also able to provoke Google and start&nbsp;
the biggest tech war since like iOS vs Android.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:09.840
And now, they suddenly have the full financial&nbsp;
support and attention of a $2.5 trillion company.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:15.720
So, the answer is no, OpenAI cannot afford to&nbsp;
